\& %f     Free blocks
\& %i     File System ID in hex
\& %l     Maximum length of filenames
\& %n     File name
\& %s     Block size (for faster transfer)
\& %S     Fundamental block size (for block counts)
\& %t     Type in hex
\& %T     Type in human readable form
.Ve
